%% Content approval workflow (UML activity, informal)
flowchart LR
  A[Author edits content/ sources] --> B[fs_content validate: schema, references, scripture text, inclusive variants, license metadata]
  B -->|fail| A
  B -->|pass| C[Package draft vN + review packet]
  C --> D{Reviewer types required}
  D --> E[Theology reviewer approves]
  D --> F[Fitness reviewer approves]
  E & F --> G[approved.yaml signed by humans - protected zone]
  G --> H[Publish Function: checks approvals + license != unknown]
  H --> I[Storage content/pkg/vN + Firestore manifest]
  I --> J[Apps download; runs pin version]
  J --> K[Retire old version when unused]
  X[AI agent] -. may flag issues only .-> C
